events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":105,"digest":"sha256:d3de5148653c5655e16171f96ff4a606e229b2a872ce52a9952f537d6d9f8a17","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:14:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:14:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.10/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/assets/565840824","id":565840824,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUZPJh84hugu4","name":"UPDATE.zh-CN.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"yinsn","id":102125674,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhZQag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102125674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn","html_url":"https://github.com/yinsn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":2050,"digest":"sha256:a4f46ac25c27a40bd2a739c215e4ba942c56fafe18d03b166ecfda853aa1bf59","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:14:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:14:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.10/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.2.10","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.2.10","body":"# 释手 0.2.10 · 英文纠偏与中英文空格\n\n构建：20260915-140403（UTC）\n\n## 本次改动\n\n- **智能整理支持英文纠偏**：结合个人词典和本句上下文修正英文误识、拼写和错误拆词，纠正后的英文不再因原始拼写变化而被直接退回。中文句子中的独立英文词会获得少量相近词典候选，由模型结合句意选择。\n- **所有模式统一补齐中英文空格**：智能整理、规则整理、跳过整理和模型回退，都在最终输出时处理间距。例如 `用Astra检查API` 会输出 `用 Astra 检查 API`。保留内部标点和换行，继续去掉句末标点。\n- 修复将“非常”里的“非”当作否定词，导致正常整理被拒绝的问题。数字、版本号和中英文否定词仍会检查。\n\n英文纠偏需要开启「设置 → 文字整理 → 智能整理」，常用专名可加入个人词典。候选只作拼写参考，不做无条件替换；正常英文短语和明确要求保留的名称应保留。词典仍不直接改变语音识别，也不能保证恢复所有听错或漏听的词。中英文空格无需开启智能整理。\n\n本次模型保持不变，语音识别与整理继续在本机运行。已通过本机模型纠偏、正常英文对照、原有中文整理和输出格式回归测试。\n\n## 更新方法\n\n- **0.2.2 或更新版本**：打开「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新 → 下载并更新」。\n- **0.2.1 或更早版本**：下载本次轻量更新包，退出释手，运行包内的 `FreeJotUpdater.app`，选择原来的完整离线应用，可直接升级到 0.2.10。\n- **新 Mac 首次安装**：按[完整安装指南](https://yinsn.github.io/FreeJot-Updates/INSTALL.md)安装含模型的 0.2.4 完整包，再在应用内更新到 0.2.10。轻量更新包不含首次安装所需的模型。\n\n更新保留本机模型、个人词典、听写历史和已保存设置。完成后在「关于释手」核对版本与构建号，并确认打开的是安装目录中的 `FreeJot.app`。\n"}